    "body": "Is entry correct here (and below) or should it be this's relevant global object? (Which would require us to pass this.)\r\n\r\nFor instance, say a click handler in the parent stores `iframe.contentWindow` as `childWindow`, then calls `iframe.remove()`, and then calls `childWindow.open()`, this says that should work, right?",
