    "body": "Test added in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/55475\r\n\r\nIt seems we should check both entry and relevant. With `this`'s iframe removed, Chrome and Safari TP return null and Firefox throws. With the entry's iframe removed, Safari TP returns null, and Chrome and Firefox don't invoke the listener at all. Removing the incumbent's iframe doesn't matter.\r\n",
